## Design Decisions

1. HypothesisStatus in autore-schema (not autore-core): Follows ProviderRunStatus pattern.
   autore-core cannot depend on autore-schema (circular dependency).
2. Confidence serialization changed from bare f32 to {"score": f32, "rationale": Option<String>}.
   This is a breaking change but no persisted data exists yet.
3. Status stored as TEXT discriminant + optional superseded_by BLOB in SQLite.
   Clean SQL filtering via status column; superseded_by is a FK to hypotheses(id).
4. EvidenceRecordId used for supporting/contradicting evidence (not M1 EvidenceId).
   Documented in Hypothesis struct doc comment.
5. Verification tests run under -p autore-schema (not -p autore-core) because
   HypothesisStatus lives in autore-schema per the circular dependency constraint.
